    ["<Assistant_Title1>【加入黑荆棘】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>在明亮的咖啡厅醒来，眼前是一位贵族少女，和一只……金毛大狗？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第一天解锁。完成序章《一切的起始》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>9级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、值夜典袍、脚踏车·胡桃、社交·下班休息、装备、秘晶·归来、初级生命纯露、精致钱包"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Join Blackthorn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Main Story (Reality)</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Waking up in a bright cafe, before your eyes is a noble young lady and a... golden retriever?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the first day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the prologue \"The Beginning of Everything\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>9</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Nighthawk Robe, Bicycle·Walnut, Social·Get off work, Equipment, Secret Crystal·Return, Beginner Health Potion, Exquisite Wallet",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团等级、突破与奖励】</>\n加入教团后默认从 1 级开始。通过教团玩法获得行动值，行动值满足后可提升等级。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>突破任务：</>\n部分等级在行动值满后还需要完成突破任务。未完成突破任务时，行动值仍然会累积。完成突破任务后，等级可继续提升。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>奖励领取：</>\n在等级奖励界面可直接领取奖励。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团行动值与周上限]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Level, Breakthrough and Rewards】</>\nAfter joining a Covenant, you start at Level 1 by default. Obtain Action Points through Covenant gameplay; once the points are sufficient, you can increase your level.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Breakthrough Quest: </>\nFor some levels, you must complete a breakthrough quest after reaching the Action Point cap. Action Points will continue to accumulate while the breakthrough quest is incomplete. Once completed, the level can continue to increase.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Reward Collection: </>\nRewards can be collected directly in the level rewards interface.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
